  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Protection, Inclusion and Gender equality (SPRING) - Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Social Protection, Inclusion and Gender Equality (SPRING) program will support the Philippine Government to strengthen social protection programs, gender mainstreaming and budgeting systems, and to advance social inclusion for people with disabilities and Indigenous Peoples. 

SPRING will be delivered primarily through a Managing Contractor in partnership with DFAT, to support the Philippines&#x2019; poverty reduction objectives and enhance gender equality. The program will also work with multilateral agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
